  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements:<br />Statement I: Potassium permanganate on heating at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>573</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> forms potassium manganate.</p><p>Statement II: Both potassium permanganate and potassium manganate are tetrahedral and paramagnetic in nature.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "BFX9V",
      "text": "Statement I is true but statement II is false",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LUVgq",
      "text": "Both statement I and statement II are true",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jlpT6",
      "text": "Statement I is false but statement II is true",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kjRdy",
      "text": "Both statement I and statement II are false",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>KMnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>Potassium</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>permanganate</mi></mrow></munder><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mn>573</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mover><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>Potassium</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>manganate</mi></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2c82b3ce-299c-438e-b026-a88e3579afe1-image.png\" style=\"width: 363px; height: 220px;\" /></p><p>Statement-I is correct.</p><p>Statement-II is incorrect.</p>",
